    "innovation": "This paper presents DryFlux, a machine learning-based product that improves dryland gross primary productivity predictions by explicitly incorporating water-carbon coupling, more accurately capturing seasonal and interannual variability in carbon uptake than existing global models.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
