            "paragraph": "The relation- ship between modeled (DryFlux) and observed (tower) monthly GPP for 2000-2015 with DryFlux had an R2 of 0.88 across all sites, compared to R2 = 0.43 for FLUXCOM and R2 = 0.41 for MODIS GPP (Fig. 1c).",
