            "paragraph": "Daily 0.5\u00b0 resolution FLUXCOM GPP estimates using MODIS remote sensing and CRUJRA_v1 meteorological forcing data inputs (for consistency with the CRU datasets) were downloaded from the Data Portal of the Max Planck Institute for Biogeochemistry 31,79,80.",
